KG42.register("rules-36a98e779fb180fae6c76605",{"id":"41-data_center_local_markets::v141-c-R002","paper":"41-data_center_local_markets","record":{"rule_id":"v141-c-R002","mechanism_id":"v141-a-M01","name":"Local market coordinator","process_stage":"coordination","market_meaning":"The market operator stacks energy-purchase bids submitted to the auction-based marketplace. Scope: Background description of auction-based local energy trading. Condition: When the auction-based mechanism is used. The market operator stacks energy-selling bids submitted to the auction-based marketplace. Scope: Background description of auction-based local energy trading. Condition: When the auction-based mechanism is used.","independence_rationale":"Relations governed by the approved function coordination.local_operator under the fixed relation-ownership template. Conditional branches retain their explicit scope in local constraints.","V":["bidding.demand","bidding.supply","coordination.local_operator"],"E":[{"edge_id":"v141-c-R002-E001","source":"bidding.demand","target":"coordination.local_operator","type":"links","constraint_ids":["v141-c-R002-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E02"]},{"edge_id":"v141-c-R002-E002","source":"bidding.supply","target":"coordination.local_operator","type":"links","constraint_ids":["v141-c-R002-C002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E02"]}],"omega":{"market_type":"LEM","network_level":null,"jurisdiction":null,"pricing_scope":null,"time_scale":null,"participant_types":[],"trading_stage":"coordination","context_text":"Background description of auction-based local energy trading.","unknown_fields":["network_level","jurisdiction","pricing_scope","time_scale","participant_types"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E02"]},"x":[],"theta":[],"phi":[{"constraint_id":"v141-c-R002-C001","kind":"procedural","role":"core","statement":"The market operator stacks energy-purchase bids submitted to the auction-based marketplace. Scope: Background description of auction-based local energy trading. Condition: When the auction-based mechanism is used.","expression":null,"formalization_origin":"not_formalized","template_id":null,"members":["bidding.demand","coordination.local_operator"],"variable_refs":[],"parameter_refs":[],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E02"]},{"constraint_id":"v141-c-R002-C002","kind":"procedural","role":"core","statement":"The market operator stacks energy-selling bids submitted to the auction-based marketplace. Scope: Background description of auction-based local energy trading. Condition: When the auction-based mechanism is used.","expression":null,"formalization_origin":"not_formalized","template_id":null,"members":["bidding.supply","coordination.local_operator"],"variable_refs":[],"parameter_refs":[],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E02"]}],"pi":[{"evidence_id":"v141-b-g01-E02","location":{"location_id":"src-307a684414-p02-c1r4__v141-a-M01-participation","page":2,"printed_page":null,"section":"Nomenclature / Introduction","anchor_text":"more practical scenario would be enabling IDCs to participate in local energy markets in power distr","equation_id":null,"figure_id":null,"table_id":null,"image_ref":"pages/page-02.png","occurrence_role":"definition"},"source_text":"Unlike grid-scale energy markets, the participants in a local energy market can have dual roles: in some time points, it can act as an energy buyer to purchase deficit energy from the market; in some other time points, it can act as an energy seller to sell the surplus energy to the market. Both auction market-based and Peer-to-Peer (P2P) negotiation-based mechanisms have been studied for the local energy trading. In the former, energy consumers and producers submit energy purchase/selling bids to an auction-based marketplace, and the market operator stacks the bids and determines the market clearing price for energy trading. In the latter, energy consumers and producers autonomously negotiate the price and amount of energy trading in a P2P manner [11]."}],"field_notes":{"empty_E_reason":null,"empty_x_reason":"The frozen rule contains only the procedural market-role nodes bidding.demand, bidding.supply, and coordination.local_operator. The cited source passage describes bid submission and stacking qualitatively and does not define bid-selection or operational decision variables for this rule; no typed variable objects are declared in the frozen R002 graph.","empty_theta_reason":"The cited source passage provides no numerical coefficients, bid-stacking parameters, or fixed constants for this procedural description, and no parameter objects are declared in the frozen R002 graph."},"evidence_basis":"explicit","implementation_status":"unimplemented","status":"needs_review","lead_ids":["v141-a-M01-clearing","v141-a-M01-participation","v141-a-M01-pricing"],"extras":{"decision_anchor":"coordination.local_operator","graph_fact_supports":[[{"evidence_id":"v141-b-g01-E02","quote":"energy consumers and producers submit energy purchase/selling bids to an auction-based marketplace, and the market operator stacks the bids"}],[{"evidence_id":"v141-b-g01-E02","quote":"energy consumers and producers submit energy purchase/selling bids to an auction-based marketplace, and the market operator stacks the bids"}]],"C2_formalization":{"graph_sha256":"185cfe2efde0cadbca8f9526e63c66682156f89ddef004e783cb61e2b1021299","applicability":"non_mathematical","reason":"The cited source passage (v141-b-g01-E02) describes the auction-based local-trading alternative in background terms: energy consumers and producers submit purchase/selling bids to an auction-based marketplace, and the market operator stacks the bids. This rule captures that qualitative bid-stacking role only. The source does not provide bid-set notation, bid variables, an ordering rule, a stacking equation, or parameter definitions for this scope; the clearing-price determination mentioned in the same passage belongs to a separate pricing rule. Accordingly, the frozen rule's two constraints remain procedural and are not formalized as mathematical expressions.","bindings":[{"object_id":"v141-c-R002-C001","node_ids":["bidding.demand","coordination.local_operator"],"edge_ids":["v141-c-R002-E001"],"rationale":"This procedural constraint is represented by the existing link from the demand-bidding node to the local-operator node: demand bids are submitted to the auction-based marketplace and stacked by the market operator."},{"object_id":"v141-c-R002-C002","node_ids":["bidding.supply","coordination.local_operator"],"edge_ids":["v141-c-R002-E002"],"rationale":"This procedural constraint is represented by the existing link from the supply-bidding node to the local-operator node: selling bids are submitted to the auction-based marketplace and stacked by the market operator."}],"revision_requests":[]}},"quarantined_references":[]}});
